00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.580
to keep your data safe and
secure at scale on GCS.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:25.790
So, agenda.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.120
First we're going to
look at GCS as a product

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:29.705
and its various capabilities.

00:00:29.705 --> 00:00:32.080
Then we're going to go through
some highly differentiated

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:34.588
security fundamentals
that GCS has to offer.

00:00:34.588 --> 00:00:36.130
And then Chester is
going to take you

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:37.960
through some highlighted
